# Route: guide 9 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 28 to
# 31, 24 quests, 2.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Thousand Needles): Freewind Post -> Splithoof Crag -> Darkcloud
# Pinnacle -> Highperch -> Freewind Post -> Splithoof Crag -> Darkcloud
# Pinnacle -> Highperch -> Darkcloud Pinnacle -> Freewind Post -> The
# Shimmering Flats -> Freewind Post -> The Screeching Canyon -> Freewind Post.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Hypercapacitor Gizmo (5151;
# Enraged Panther 30); Encrusted Tail Fins (1107; Saltscale Warrior 35-36,
# Saltscale Oracle 36-37, Saltscale Tide Lord 37, Saltscale Forager 35-36,
# Saltscale Hunter 35-36); A Host of Evil (6626; Razorfen Battleguard 33-34,
# Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34, Death's Head Cultist 33-34).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Gahz'rilla (2770).

